; MADRIGUERA - resident UI tiles (ui-designer). 21 tiles of the GDD 7.2 budget of 24 (BG slot after
; dungeon/title). Loaded by EVERY screen_build (title, play, gameover, ending) with the LCD off; the
; pause and the dialogue never load tiles. Used by the HUD and the boxes in the window and by the full
; screens. APPEND ONLY: code relies on these runs:
;   FRAME_TL..FRAME_BR (8, order TL T TR L R BL B BR; the 9th piece of a box is BLANK)
;   HEART_FULL HEART_HALF HEART_EMPTY (3, consecutive: tile = HEART_FULL + state)
;   MAP_DOOR_V MAP_DOOR_H_T MAP_DOOR_H_B (pause map links)
; Studio frame language: thick black line + thin inner line + 1 px white outer margin, rounded
; corners. MADRIGUERA theme: the inner line is a dashed stitch (sewn sackcloth of the mole pantry),
; period 4, symmetric so the corners meet it. No HUD separator line (user preference).
; HUD glyphs (hearts, icons, cursor) use rows 0-6 and cols 0-6 like the font: same baseline.

; ---------------- blank: box fill, window row 1, empty HUD cells, tab gaps (keep first)
@ BLANK
........
........
........
........
........
........
........
........

