; ---------------- "more text" arrow: a FRAME_B with a down triangle above the stitch. Replaces the
; FRAME_B at col 17 of a box's bottom row; blinks 16/16 f with FRAME_B while the box waits for A.
@ ARROW_DOWN
.######.
..####..
...##...
+..++..+
